      "cooked": "<p>I can’t create workspace, the button “Add Workspace” on the top right is missing</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/a/7/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6_2_690x216.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"nVTh89GSDgKZvCkGvV7Imi6O0bY\" width=\"690\" height=\"216\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6_2_690x216.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6_2_1035x324.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/a/7/a7bd48a98a2ea06420a50d193ddcf4148269ddf6_2_1380x432.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F8\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2329×732 86.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Searching for “Desktop Icon” in the Awesome Bar or global search returns no results at all. However, manually navigating to <code>/desk/desktop-icon/</code> does load the Desktop Icon list, and I’m able to open the Desktop Icon form. I’ve tried creating and editing icons using all available options (External, Workspace Sidebar, Link, Folder, App). In all cases, saving succeeds without errors, but no visible change appears on the Desk. Editing existing Desktop Icons also has no effect. The only action that consistently works is hiding an icon — any other modification (link, label, type, workspace, app, etc.) simply does nothing.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/9/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd_2_690x297.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"lPPQgXPeNtBqm74yndR3ftU3grH\" width=\"690\" height=\"297\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd_2_690x297.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd_2_1035x445.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/9/9909b4279bef05ac71f48cd91f70f7015e8e6cfd_2_1380x594.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"A1A2A3\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1891×816 48.6 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>While I can create a Workspace Sidebar, it doesn’t seem to attach to anything unless it’s linked to a Desktop Icon, and without that link it effectively counts as “none.” This makes me wonder whether I’m missing a required step or permission. For context, this is on the 14-day free trial running ERPNext v16.1</p>",
